        <activityName xml:lang="en">Thermoforming, with calendering</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Thermoforming, with calendering
1 kg of this process equals 0.977 kg of thermoformed, calendered plastic sheets.;
UUID: 1ffa6ab5-c407-3f6b-af05-50054a391ca9
This process contains the auxillaries and energy demand for the mentioned convertion process of plastics. The converted amount of plastics is NOT included into the dataset.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: present technologies
Time period: time to which data refer
Production volume: na
Sampling: company data 
Extrapolations: no extrapolation
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_1ffa6ab5-c407-3f6b-af05-50054a391ca9.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
